{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51273","headline":"南陵五松山别荀七 · 李白","name":"南陵五松山别荀七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六即颍水荀，何惭许郡宾。\n相逢太史奏，应是聚贤人。\n玉隐且在石，兰枯还见春。\n俄成万里别，立德贵清真。\n（见影宋蜀刻本《李太白文集》卷十三，「立德」作「立得」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}